    likes: 1,
    text: 'Seedance 2.5 Prompt: "ART STYLE Strictly follow this 2D animation style: hand-painted digital gouache with visible dry-brush grain and unclosed edges, zero outlines — form defined entirely by flat blocked color. Chunky geometric shape design with extreme size contrast between characters. Limited high-chroma palette on large flat value masses. Backgrounds reduced to silhouetted notan planes with silhouetted foreground framing. Action beats drop the environment entirely for a single saturated color field. Highly cinematic 2D animation. REFERENCES Environment: environment.png Character consistency — Gorlock: gorlock-sheet.png Character consistency — Turan: turan-sheet.png SCENE Two mountain-scale monsters fight a chaotic, majestic, epic, explosive, huge-impact battle in the environment above. Opens mid-action on a close-up of Gorlock roaring, furious and enraged. Turan comes down as a living inferno bullet, crashing into the ground where Gorlock stands. They charge into each other immediately and fight with physical attacks, elemental force and magic at massive scale impact range. CAMERA & PACING 24 different, distinct camera angles, none repeated. An epic, non-stop fight — never stationary, fast-paced, with strong build-up pacing and clear key moments. High-speed motion and movement from both characters throughout. MOTION & PHYSICS Weight before speed — every charge starts with a heavy compressed crouch, then explosive release. Anticipation held two beats longer than natural, impact snapped to a single frame, recovery slowed by drag. Mass follows through: mane, fire-fur and smoke lag half a beat behind the body, then overshoot and settle. Ground reacts before the body lands — dust rings and flattening grass telegraph each footfall. Impacts push through, never stopping at contact: bodies deform on collision, slide, and dig trenches. Camera shake scales to impact size, settling with inertia rather than snapping back. Speed ramps: slow on wind-up, real-time on approach, brief hold at contact, fast on the throw-through. Debris travels as flat chunky shards on arcing parabolic paths, tumbling as it falls. SFX Deep sub-bass roar with a gravel throat rasp. Low-frequency ground rumble under every footfall. Tearing crackle of open flame. Sharp crystalline chime on each energy discharge. Whip-crack air displacement on the charge. Granular soil and rock crumble on landing. Distant echo rolling back off the far hills. Low sustained wind bed between hits. VFX Hard-edged white shockwave discs on every impact. Flat radial dust rings expanding outward. Brush-textured ember showers rising in slow drift. Chunky flat debris shards. Green energy lances with spiked hard-edge silhouettes. Violet smoke ribbons in flat blocked masses. Screen-wide saturated color-field flashes at peak contact. Heat shimmer rendered as offset dry-brush strokes. Dirt streaks flicking across the lens. ENGAGEMENT RULE (strict, entire video) Gorlock and Turan always face each other and always move toward each other. They never turn away, never retreat, never flee, and never run in the same direction or side by side. Every displacement is either a charge into the opponent or being driven backward by the opponent while still facing them — their motion vectors are permanently opposed and head-on from the first frame to the last. ENDING The video ends still in the middle of the action. Both are still fighting, neither has shown any sign of defeat, and the battle is far from over."',
